<mxCell id="97" value="OPEN ITEMS (dashed orange boxes):&#10;#1 Schema sales_raw vs raw — strong evidence, not SME-confirmed&#10;#2 leads_raw scope — assumed out of scope, documented rationale&#10;#3 Extraction mechanism — assumed ours to build&#10;#4 WRAPPED_ACTIVITIES — genuinely open, undiscoverable from data&#10;#5 DEA_INTERNAL flag — working assumption, IS_INTERNAL filter&#10;   temporarily removed (every setter/closer in data is internal)&#10;&#10;RESOLVED BY SME:&#10;#6 Reporting tool — Streamlit in Snowflake CONFIRMED &amp; LIVE&#10;Export Layer — confirmed NOT REQUIRED (gray boxes, bottom-left)&#10;#7 Outcome duplication — resolved via field-scoped mapping&#10;&#10;PRODUCTION VALIDATION: 6 real bugs found + fixed against live data&#10;(payload wrapper, stale S3 reload, field dedup, flat-key structure,&#10;MERGE key mismatch, dashboard metric math) — see Solution Design&#10;Doc Section 12 for full detail. 7-day production simulation&#10;CONFIRMED COMPLETE via TASK_HISTORY (7/7 consecutive successes).&#10;&#10;MONITORING (blue dashed boxes, right column) — added per&#10;SME feedback: no failure/fallback pipeline was originally shown" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CC0000;fontSize=10;fontColor=#CC0000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="960" y="60" width="340" height="290" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
